{"thread":{"threadID":3894,"boardID":13,"topic":"Lob an Stabiler Jesus","time":1478309522,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1478362394,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":12,"views":466,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":4},"tags":[{"tagID":771,"name":"die"},{"tagID":964,"name":"festgehalten"},{"tagID":828,"name":"hier"},{"tagID":250,"name":"Hilfe"},{"tagID":692,"name":"ich"},{"tagID":966,"name":"polizei"},{"tagID":965,"name":"ruft"},{"tagID":963,"name":"werde"}],"posts":[{"postID":51584,"threadID":3894,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Lob an Stabiler Jesus","time":1478309522,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1478312925,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1478316651,"value":1},{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1478331377,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1478343792,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1478360100,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1478335992,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hiermit möchte ich ein enorm großes Lob an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1125-stabiler-jesus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Stabiler Jesus</a> aussprechen!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ist auch echt an der Zeit, anscheinend kriegt jeder einen Lobthread, aber der Wichtigste wird mal wieder vergessen...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Deshalb hier von meiner Seite aus: Lob für einen der <strong>besten Dudes</strong> bei Dream! Einfach props.  <span class=\"missing-media\">[8)]</span> <br>Selten findet man so eine Person im Leben und ich bin so dankbar, dass ich das Vergnügen hatte, dich als engen Freund zu haben.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><s>Mert</s> Stabiler Jesus, du liest das sicher, du bist ein Toller Freund dir kann ich Private sachen anvertrauen<br>und du bist da wenn ich brauche #Nohomo an der Stelle. Danke!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>(Erschreckender weise muss ich feststellen das ich der erste bin der <s>ViruszZ </s>Stabiler Jesus lobt  <span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span> )</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wenn du mal bei mir in der Stadt vorbeikommst, schreib mich gerne auf Kik an, dann spendiere ich dir ein Eis <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51585,"threadID":3894,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1478309903,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Autsch.<br>Right in da feels.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51586,"threadID":3894,"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","subject":"","time":1478313111,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1478360116,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51587,"threadID":3894,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1478331469,"lastEditTime":1478342106,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":1125,"editor":"Stabiler Jesus","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1478348518,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1478351990,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Danke dir Nachtfrische für diese netten Worte. Nach unserem gestrigen Telefonat bei Mondlicht ist mal wieder klar geworden was ein faszinierend toller Mensch du bist! Das können wir gerne wiederholen!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p>So und später noch 3 weitere Threads sonst kommst du aus dem Keller nicht mehr raus!</p></details>","polls":[]},{"postID":51589,"threadID":3894,"userID":2287,"username":"Krokoblack","subject":"","time":1478339622,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":nu